# Deferred Work

IMPORTANT FOR AI AGENTS: Do NOT execute, implement, or act on anything in this file
without the user explicitly saying "do the TODO: <item name>". These are intentionally
deferred tasks that require human judgement on timing. Treat this file as read-only notes.

Desktop paths written as src/, src-tauri/, assets/, scripts/, CHANGELOG.md, or
THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md are relative to apps/desktop after the monorepo migration.

Index work happens in apps/index/, never in the standalone modrex-index repository at
C:\local\modrexio\modrex-index. That checkout is the frozen legacy producer for desktop
versions through 0.12.2 and must not gain new features.

Two index paths coexist inside apps/index/, and entries below name which one they mean:
- The PRODUCTION path: postgres/*.ts, with Neon as the source of truth, per-game SQLite
  snapshots exported by postgres/export-sqlite.ts and published to R2 at index.modrex.net.
- The LEGACY builder: build-index.ts, which still writes a single monolithic index.db for
  the frozen release. Do not extend it.

